.TH ARGUS-SETUP-RUNTIME 1 "2026-11-27" "argus 1.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
argus-setup-runtime \- provision or update the Python runtime used by argus
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B argus-setup-runtime
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B argus-setup-runtime
creates the private Python environment in
.I /var/lib/argus-scanner/runtime
from the argus wheel shipped in the
.B argus-scanner
package and the current releases of its dependencies.
.PP
Because the package contains no compiled objects, the environment matches the
local Python version and architecture, and Semgrep is updated whenever the
runtime is rebuilt.  The
.B postinst
script runs this command once during installation; it never fails the
installation if the download is impossible.
.PP
Installations without network access can build the runtime from a directory
of wheels created on another machine:
.IP
.nf
pip download argus-scanner semgrep -d wheels
argus-setup-runtime --wheelhouse wheels
.fi
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-\-wheelhouse " " \fIDIR\fR
Install offline from a directory of wheels.
.TP
.BR \-\-semgrep " " \fIVERSION\fR
Pin Semgrep to an exact version instead of the latest release.
.TP
.B \-\-upgrade-semgrep
Update only Semgrep inside an existing runtime.  The new version is verified;
if it does not run, the previous one is reinstalled.
.TP
.B \-\-list
Print the runtime location, Python, argus and Semgrep versions and size.
.TP
.B \-\-remove
Delete the runtime.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short usage summary.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ARGUS_WHEELHOUSE
Wheel directory used by
.B postinst
when the package is installed.
.TP
.B ARGUS_SKIP_RUNTIME_SETUP
Set to 1 to install the package without contacting the package index.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /var/lib/argus-scanner/runtime
The private virtual environment.
.TP
.I /usr/lib/argus-scanner/argus_scanner-*.whl
The argus wheel shipped in this package.
.TP
.I /etc/argus-scanner/wheelhouse
Optional file whose first line names a wheel directory for offline installs.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The requested action succeeded, or the runtime is already absent for
.BR \-\-list .
.TP
.B 1
The runtime could not be created or the new Semgrep does not run.
.TP
.B 2
Usage error or missing privileges.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR argus (1),
.I /usr/share/doc/argus-scanner/README.Debian
.SH AUTHOR
argus contributors.
